# Voice of Victory: "Your opponents can't cast spells during your turn."
#
# Bot1 casts Voice on turn 1. Bot2 plays a Mountain on turn 2 and then holds Lightning Bolt with the Mountain untapped
# through all of Bot1's turn 3, where the cast line waits: Bolt is never offered while Bot1 is the active player. The
# first time it is offered is Bot2's own turn-4 upkeep, which is when the line fires and Bolt resolves.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Voice of Victory
Plains x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x13

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Voice of Victory.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
[T3 Bot1.Upkeep]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Tapped = false
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
? Turn = 4
? ActivePlayer = Bot2

[Expect]
Turn = 4
ActivePlayer = Bot2
Bot1.Life = 17
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Battlefield = Plains; Mox Pearl; Voice of Victory
